  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Economic Reform Accelerator will support the government of South Africa to deliver growth-enhancing economic reforms targeted at the binding constraints to growth. Through technical assistance and policy-focused research provided to senior policymakers in economic-cluster ministries the programme will address capacity bottlenecks in design and implementation of the government&#x2019;s reform agenda.</narrative>
  </description>
